yle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. <strong>복&nbsp; 학</strong>(<strong>인터넷 신청</strong>)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><u>2012. 02. 14(화) ~ 02. 17(금)[4일간]</u></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▶ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>수강신청 및 등록금 납부만으로는 복학처리가 되지 않습니다.</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 군제대복학예정자의 전역일자가 1/4선(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 03. 28</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) 이후일 경우에는&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원지원팀&nbsp;☎(054)478-7015, 7018으로 문의 바람 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청절차 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① kit포탈 → </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스 → 학사관리 → 학적</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> → 복학신청</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪특히 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보를 입력 바람≫ </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">② 복학 확정 여부 확인 : 신청 및 구비서류 제출 후 익일 1시 이후 확정 여부 확인 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;≪조회 : kit포탈 → 원스톱서비스 → 학적부→ 학적자료조회 → 학적변동≫</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 복학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 03. 28</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">)까지만 허용이 가능함 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">단, 등록기간(2012. 2. 14 ~ 2. 17)내에 등록금을 납부한 학생만 해당됨</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></